  "source_shape_findings": [
    "Preserves B1+5F connected main building, high right wing, lower left wing, true1F west auditorium attachment, lower southeast skin, shared lift and end stairs. p143 table6F is contradicted by actual roof label: no extra occupied sixth floor.",
    "Raw source trace and three-common-core affine registrations preserved numerically. Repeated2/3F wall planes regularized to remove diagram-scale/shear-induced fictitious serrated stacking, while real1F annexes,4F425 sloping classroom,lower roofs and projecting stair changes remain. Not surveyed as-built dimensions.",
    "Both wings use common floor levels. Only bounded left4Froof is lowered for photo-guided proportions;425 lecture room retained under a local slope instead of misreading it as empty3Froof. Different per-wing accumulated floor heights were rejected.",
    "Right2Fhall plus3/4FX is a finite enclosed negative cavity capped by occupied5F635sqm floor andR. Left2/3F finite hall void is separately capped by4F rooms. Neither is a through-roof courtyard; no cavity filled to force one boundary shell.",
    "839 shallow cream+Xend and841 darker small-window−Ylongface are bounded relative registration, not compass/unique survey. Photo-left at+X maps to−Y: earlier+Ylow-box claim withdrawn in external correction936d9385. Real1Flower skin retained without pretending a room name or smallX proves the exact photo box.",
    "839 upper three facade bands include a genuine recessed top loggia with coarse railing. Red canopy/lower two-floor external band heights remain approximate; no floor deletion or hall filling to force photo alignment. Earlier wide false white entry strip replaced by a real recess with opaque glass back.",
    "Bounded skirt and approximate slope contact support the source-traced overhangs without inventing unknown campus columns/complete terrain. Roof five neutral bands have unknown function, not PV/skylights or through-holes. Unknown rear detail stays neutral rather than mirrored photo windows.",
    "Boolean original-run material provenance retained directly; no nearest-surface repaint. Fine railing revised in generator rather than deleted at QA. Seven opaque colors are independent proxies, no source photo/plan pixels or textures."
  ],
